@token = paste-access-token-here

### Login as Asha; copy access_token to the variable above
POST http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"asha@example.test","password":"OrbitDesk-Demo-2026!"}

### Operator login (needed for all-account demo overview)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"support@example.test","password":"OrbitDesk-Operator-2026!"}

### Health (public)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8766/health

### Three synthetic cases
GET http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/demo/scenarios
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Current subscription and actual feature access
GET http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/accounts/acct_duplicate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invoice and all payment attempts
GET http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/accounts/acct_duplicate/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Two attempts, but neither is a confirmed successful charge
GET http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/accounts/acct_pending/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a persistent support ticket
POST http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "account_id": "acct_duplicate",
  "subject": "Charged twice and missing Pro access",
  "description": "I upgraded yesterday, was charged twice, and still cannot access the paid features."
}

### Your verified identity
GET http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revoke this session
POST http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Policy index status
GET http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/retrieval/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inspect policy passages (not account records)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/retrieval/chunks?as_of=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Compare methods by changing bm25 / dense / hybrid
POST http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/retrieval/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"query":"I was charged twice. What evidence is needed for a refund?","method":"hybrid","top_k":3,"as_of":"2026-10-31"}

### Rebuild policy index (operator token only, cached model required)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/retrieval/reindex
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"strategy":"heading","max_tokens":180}

### Run the small development evaluation (operator only)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/retrieval/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Safe Gemini configuration status (never includes the key)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/rag/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inspect the prompt without generation or a saved turn
POST http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/rag/preview
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"question":"What evidence and approval are required for a duplicate-charge refund?","method":"bm25","as_of":"2026-10-31"}

### Generate a checked policy answer (real provider quota)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/rag/answer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"question":"What evidence and approval are required for a duplicate-charge refund?","method":"bm25","as_of":"2026-10-31"}

### Create a private conversation; copy returned id below
POST http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/conversations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"title":"Duplicate-charge policy question"}

@conversation_id = paste-returned-conversation-id

### Follow-up with memory and validation-first NDJSON streaming
POST http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/rag/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"question":"Does that mean a refund has already been issued to me?","conversation_id":"{{conversation_id}}","method":"bm25","as_of":"2026-10-31"}

### Read your saved conversation
GET http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/conversations/{{conversation_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Investigate records and policies; creates proposals but executes nothing
POST http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/investigations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"account_id":"acct_duplicate","complaint":"I upgraded yesterday, was charged twice, and cannot access Pro features.","event_date":"2026-10-31"}

### List authorized investigations
GET http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/investigations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@proposal_id = paste-returned-proposal-id

### Review a pending proposal (operator token; does not execute)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/proposals/{{proposal_id}}/decision
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"decision":"approve","note":"Reviewed verified records and supporting policy evidence."}

### Explicit simulated execution (operator token; retry SAME key for same request)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/proposals/{{proposal_id}}/execute
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"idempotency_key":"manual-demo-execution-001"}

### Current ledger including simulated refunds and net paid
GET http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/tools/billing/acct_duplicate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Audit history for authorized account
GET http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/accounts/acct_duplicate/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Operational readiness and usage (operator only)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/system/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
